% Extensional constraint benchmark, family randtab (n=10 d=5 m=10 a=3 t=40 seed=7, seed 7).
% 10 random positive tables of arity 3 with 40 tuples each over 10 variables with domain 0..4.
% Generated by a deterministic Python generator; the search is fixed so that the
% first solution does not depend on propagation strength.

include "table.mzn";

